{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "44dcedfee9043d415fcdbdc6fe3acd241752843121dadc772b7b63c40157cbb6", "ja": "次へ、その先へ！", "zh": "迈向下一个、更远的前方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "557c9ca0722cf32d4e2d3957f1eb340a6ad9b43c6ca7bdd6a94716bbc3cd69c7", "ja": "『ShineLight』公演が大盛況に終わり、\nメッセージボードに思いの丈を綴るメンバー\n達。武道館へ向けた決意や、次のチームへの\nエールなど、それぞれの願いを言葉に込め、\n彼女達はさらなるステージへと進んでいく。", "zh": "“ShineLight”公演圆满落幕，\n成员们在留言板上倾诉着各自的心声。\n面向武道馆的决心、对下一支队伍的\n加油打气等，将各自的心愿寄托于话语之中，\n她们向着更高一层的舞台迈步前行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52f5f6dc4bbe10a367a1a8b29b04070997cc78ce3286fb115bab9e871eaa6422", "ja": "（765プロによる首都エリアツアー第2弾、\n『ShineLight』公演は、連日大盛況だ！）", "zh": "（由765事务所带来的首都地区巡演第2弹，《ShineLight》公演，连续多日都盛况空前！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f03a70998aca627e91df3da4b7431661d56267b04172ec587e48396fd75a278f", "ja": "（……ところで、みんなが控え室に集まって、\n何かしているみたいだ。例のアレかな？）", "zh": "（……话说回来，大家好像都聚在休息室里，在做什么事情。难道是那个？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "c17e7fb01e594285b1ece8ee4d7b4fc0ae8cb94e74076be2bf05622788a586b9", "ja": "っと、こんなもんかな？\n我ながらなかなかいいこと書けたかも……うん！", "zh": "呃，差不多就是这样吧？\n没想到我还挺会写的嘛……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "abad8d36a1921293c411af8a7a5bc8e39c171153749feb103cea23f2d178f9c4", "ja": "わあ、律子さん、文才ありますね！\n武道館への熱い気持ちが、ひしひしと伝わってきます！", "zh": "哇，律子小姐，您很有文采呢！\n对武道馆的热切心情，真真切切地传达出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "6cb04109bdfe6e63d956962d3dbd798ebecfe30423641bc9f05137e75b8ca3ce", "ja": "あら、百合子に褒められるなんて光栄だわ。\nふふっ♪", "zh": "哎呀，能被百合子夸奖真是深感荣幸呢。\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "05bc54f1567529e62d690ac8a9e30730909d16c18d5fa62b9c9c43e0dd37a62e", "ja": "ウーン……ワタシはこういうの、\nあんまり得意じゃないんだよネ～。レイカはどう？", "zh": "嗯……这种事情，我可不太擅长呢～。丽花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a544fed7c9527fb34f4c085d9205185a7095bed0ab3ccfb0b1b05da357300b0", "ja": "はいはーい！　私はこんなの書いたよ？\nじゃじゃじゃじゃーん♪", "zh": "来啦来啦！我写了这样的哦？\n锵锵锵锵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "f4e7dfaaa94972bc59453ab6c95562663fade3690ad2bf1724e3764fc2ec8ec6", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、独特のセンスしてるから、\n参考になるかしら……ちなみに私のはこれよ。", "zh": "丽花的品味很独特，不知道能不能给我参考……顺便说，这是我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "324dda9bf6a288f7be81c1bda2a0f50eb40534db1b8c7fe9d1f82badff24ca46", "ja": "ワオ！　ふたりともいいナ～♪　なるほど、\nこういう風に書くんだネ！　やってみるヨ～！", "zh": "哇！你们两个写得都不错呢～♪ 原来如此，原来要这样写呀！我也来试试～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "6b5cdb6c65946ad97f0ae2cfc76a00e48a3751e7a19b5d2ac97dfb252afb34e6", "ja": "あら……百合子ちゃんたら、凄い集中力……\n『ゾーン』に入ってるわ！", "zh": "哎呀……百合子这孩子，专注度真惊人……\n已经进入“心流状态”了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1011_null", "source_sha256": "c2071ce1ac5ab81faba7ab06019d6fec6037f76f276511ee0f4230c56ea2b674", "ja": "カリカリカリカリカリ……。", "zh": "沙沙沙沙沙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "e0e52c18dda0983fdeb2719a2902d73467479871ef652f57666967ac0cf133da", "ja": "あはは、百合子らしいわね。どんな内容なのかしら……\nって、{$P$}！？　いつからそこに！", "zh": "啊哈哈，很有百合子的风格呢。到底写了些什么内容呢……\n咦，{$P$}！？你什么时候在那儿的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c09dc5b2596dfbf9f30dbe267b699276cd3fd39c318ef8cb62d13827ae1d2ba7", "ja": "え、ちょっと前から……。", "zh": "诶，从刚才开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "b1cba7716b1cf624253a3d941a83ebc175cfeab2766011476339866cb2bfdb53", "ja": "あら！　ダメよ覗き見なんて。\n我慢できなくなっちゃったの？　ふふっ。", "zh": "哎呀！偷看可不行哦。\n忍不住了吗？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d60a8b5d12e3018e605af17e9b3f261a08c14e5cdfd9642e5588812bd89dcefe", "ja": "い、いや、覗き見だなんてそんな……。\nまあ、そりゃ、ちょっとは気になりますけど。", "zh": "不、不是，哪能叫偷看啊……\n不过，好吧，确实是有那么一点在意就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "fe73e5bf7c6247072ea5e3fb1b66c0c7de55b6c0e6e588116d0d13e87ae19dc3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……めっ、だよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……不、不可以偷看哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1017_p", "source_sha256": "542795f2870fb891fa08e1b4dc3238644dce26562348ceaf7b1786bacdaae048", "ja": "あ、ああ……ゴメン！\n見ないよ、見ない見ない……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……对不起！\n我不看，我不看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "9cd0c2a24ee8907078f46d09bd256e77236152bdff258618462eb95102dc815a", "ja": "武道館への、決意……次のチームへのエール……。\nそして……導きの太陽への、感謝……。", "zh": "前往武道馆的决心……对下一个团队的鼓励……。\n以及……对指引我们的太阳的感谢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
