{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "47e098201325a454ca5e6c1f103c83502bce7c17718d4030f8dbb43e7592f163", "ja": "百合子、ちょっとよくわからなくなってきてない？\nまあ、うん……大丈夫よね、きっと！", "zh": "百合子，你是不是有点搞不清楚状况了？\n嗯，应该没事吧，肯定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "5a4e56533b67ea3e19ab6f7987fcf20464a56adb1a89012bab03adbe21f916ac", "ja": "バトン、ちゃんと渡せたかナ～？\nあ、{$P$}は見ちゃダメだヨ～♪", "zh": "我有没有好好把接力棒交出去呢～？\n啊，{$P$}可不能看哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_09_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c0b45e2d96c9010188acaf8142ac9166624babc70ac865f05735727395001b9e", "ja": "（友達として、ライバルとして……切磋琢磨し、輝きを\n増していくアイドルたち。さあ、次のステージだ！）", "zh": "（作为朋友，作为对手……偶像们彼此切磋，不断绽放更加耀眼的光芒。好了，前往下一个舞台吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
